                        "entry_id": "72a408c5-fc0c-3abd-8ad7-e1dad4be98b1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female equivalent of молдава́нин (moldavánin): female Moldavian, Moldovan (person from Moldova or of Moldovan descent)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ebeecf1-efbb-48a9-8673-5b97e7e3b78d",
                                "sense_id": "f48ea1b0-8f15-3a34-b306-869e7c0deaeb",
                                "text": "Сзади его поместились две молдаванки; оборванные, черноволосые, загорелые, они тоже скрипели песню пьяными голосами.",
                                "translation": "Behind him were two ragged women from Moldavia, black-haired and sun-burned; they were also grinding out a song.",
                                "english": "Behind him were two ragged women from Moldavia, black-haired and sun-burned; they were also grinding out a song."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
